            <profile id="5d74-0a4e-a1b9-ed46" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, light armour and large shield. May ride a horse (+11), or a Warhorse (+18). If mounted exchanges light armour and large shield for heavy armour and xyston. Army General. May be Veteran (+1). If Philip is army general, the cavalry component is reduced to a maximum of 25%. Alexander may have the Stratagem rule (+20) or may instead take the option to reroll his Oracles at the start of the game for the same points cost.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="c5b0-cff9-1c01-de09" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
