              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Prodromoi and light cavalry have hand weapon, javelins (+1) or thrusting spears (+3). Light Cavalry. Prodromoi fight in Wedge and one unit may replace javelins with xyston (+3). There may be one unit of Prodromoi for each unit of Companions.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
